#: ../../source/index.rst:5 5bde68eefb1a47099037ca45f2b8d1d1
msgid "APM Planner 2 Home"
msgstr "APM Planner 2 主页"

#: ../../source/index.rst:9 4b46d50dbb5c448b9458d69942e4037c
msgid ""
"Keep up with the latest ArduPilot related blogs on `ArduPilot.org! "
"<https://ardupilot.org/>`__"
msgstr "在 `ArduPilot.org! <https://ardupilot.org/>`__ 上了解最新 ArduPilot 相关博客"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27 66be22e888bf4b159e47fec5014fcf63
msgid ""
"APM Planner 2.0 is an open-source ground station application for `MAVlink "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/>`__ based autopilots including APM and PX4/Pixhawk "
"that can be run on Windows, Mac OSX, and Linux."
msgstr ""
"APM Planner 2.0 是一款开源地面站应用程序，适用于基于 `MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`__ "
"的飞控（包括 APM 和 PX4/Pixhawk），可在 Windows、Mac OSX 和 Linux 上运行。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44 8ba0130bb6fa45688cd75f1e140d6f4b
msgid ""
"Configure and calibrate your ArduPilot or PX4 autopilot for autonomous "
"vehicle control."
msgstr "配置和校准您的 ArduPilot 或 PX4 飞控，实现飞行器自主控制。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:54 b7800e71886342968cc4ad955b11794e
msgid "Plan a mission with GPS waypoints and control events."
msgstr "使用 GPS 航点和控制事件规划任务。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:63 4c9a8e2dc44b4bd1a78dbc938778880f
msgid "Connect a 3DR Radio to view live data and initiate commands in flight."
msgstr "连接 3DR 数传，在飞行中查看实时数据并发送指令。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:113 30b1ac44caf54976a5a5b99b25db7bd4
msgid ""
"APM Planner 2.0 is highly influenced by the simple user interface of "
"*Mission Planner* and the cross platform capability of *QGround Control*. "
"Check out the :ref:`Credits and Contributors <credits-and-contributors>` for"
" more information!"
msgstr ""
"APM Planner 2.0 深受 *Mission Planner* 简洁用户界面以及 *QGround Control* 跨平台能力的影响。查看 "
":ref:`致谢与贡献者 <credits-and-contributors>` 了解更多信息！"

#: ../../source/index.rst:119 7346ec70d0c943f59fab193845b61805
msgid "Quick Start Guide"
msgstr "快速入门指南"

#: ../../source/index.rst:121 ad7849090f4c45db94e5c1d99efe58b0
msgid ""
"Install APM Planner :ref:`for Mac OSX, <mac-install>` :ref:`Windows "
"<install-windows>` and :ref:`Linux <installation-for-linux>`."
msgstr ""
"安装适用于 :ref:`Mac OSX、 <mac-install>` :ref:`Windows <install-windows>` 和 "
":ref:`Linux <installation-for-linux>` 的 APM Planner。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:124 eba9350aa53842ff8098ee58b526204b
msgid ""
"To setup your ArduPilot, PX4, or Pixhawk autopilot, complete the topics in "
"the :ref:`Autopilot Setup section <autopilot-setup>`. If your autopilot has "
"already been configured using *Mission Planner*, there is no need to redo "
"calibration."
msgstr ""
"若要设置您的 ArduPilot、PX4 或 Pixhawk 飞控，请完成 :ref:`飞控设置章节 <autopilot-setup>` "
"中的各项主题。如果您的飞控已使用 *Mission Planner* 完成配置，则无需重新校准。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:129 926fe2220bf444858d343da7c8df1cfc
msgid ""
":ref:`Connect to Mavlink <connect-autopilot>` and get to know APM Planner's "
":ref:`Flight Data <flght-map>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`连接至 MAVLink <connect-autopilot>` 并了解 APM Planner 的 :ref:`飞行数据 <flght-"
"map>` 功能。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:132 141214221273418f8cd378e74e2d9314
msgid "Plan a mission with APM Planner."
msgstr "使用 APM Planner 规划任务。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:134 c8c4fcbe386840bbb46ec67197c6c07a
msgid ""
"**Need further help?** Visit the `APM Planner 2.0 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/ground-control-software/apm-planner-2-0>`__"
" APM Planner 2.0 forums on `discuss.ardupilot.org "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__"
msgstr ""
"**需要进一步帮助？** 请访问 `APM Planner 2.0 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/ground-"
"control-software/apm-planner-2-0>`__ 在 `discuss.ardupilot.org "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ 上的论坛。"

